    any of the sources above. The other keyword files BlockerFlow uses (the keyword tiers,
    international keywords, adult hostname brand list and page-check skip list) are not
    published here. GPL-3.0, like the rest of pornography/.
    The few web-proxy hosts BlockerFlow added by hand are CC BY-SA 4.0, like the rest of
    web-proxy/.

No UT1 "adult" data is in this repository.


